error[E3006]: cannot apply `+` to `i32` and `i64`
 --> tests/types/fail/E3006_invalid_operands.tarn:8:10
  |
8 |     c := a + b
  |          ^^^^^
  |
  = note: both operands must have the same type; numbers never convert implicitly

error[E3006]: cannot apply `+` to `bool` and `{integer}`
 --> tests/types/fail/E3006_invalid_operands.tarn:9:10
  |
9 |     d := true + 1
  |          ^^^^^^^^
  |
  = note: arithmetic needs two numbers of the same type

error[E3006]: cannot apply `==` to `P` and `P`
  --> tests/types/fail/E3006_invalid_operands.tarn:11:10
   |
11 |     e := p == p
   |          ^^^^^^
   |
   = note: `==`/`!=` need numbers, strings, booleans or a type implementing `Eq`; implement `Eq` or use `match`

error[E3006]: cannot apply `&` to `{float}` and `{integer}`
  --> tests/types/fail/E3006_invalid_operands.tarn:12:10
   |
12 |     f := 1.5 & 2
   |          ^^^^^^^
   |
   = note: bitwise operators need two integers of the same type

